  "content": "<div><br></div><div>Kronk - 2x Figurine of Wondrous Power, Golden Lions (from Nib, made of gold)</div><div><br></div><div>See rules below EXCEPT they can be used <b>once per Long Rest</b>!</div><div><br></div><div></div><div class=\"scroll-box\" style=\"overflow: auto visible; max-width: 100%; margin: 10px 0px; padding: 2px 0px;\"><div><table class=\"ve-w-100 ve-stats ve-stats--book ve-stats--bkmv\" style=\"border-spacing: 0px; border-collapse: collapse; background: rgb(34, 34, 34); width: 468px; font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12.6px; table-layout: fixed; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.176) 0px 6px 12px; color: rgb(187, 187, 187);\"><tbody><tr><th class=\"ve-stats__th-name ve-text-left ve-pb-0 \" colspan=\"6\" data-name=\"Figurine of Wondrous Power, Golden Lions\" data-page=\"items.html\" data-source=\"XDMG\" data-hash=\"figurine%20of%20wondrous%20power%2c%20golden%20lions_xdmg\" style=\"padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 4px; position: relative; font-size: 1.8em; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-caps: small-caps; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-weight: 500; padding-left: 0.2em !important; text-align: left !important;\"><div class=\"ve-split-v-end\" style=\"display: flex !important; justify-content: space-between !important; align-items: flex-end !important;\"><div class=\"ve-flex-v-center\" style=\"display: flex !important; align-items: center !important;\"><h1 class=\"ve-stats__h-name ve-copyable ve-m-0\" style=\"font-size: unset; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 500; line-height: unset; color: rgb(210, 154, 56); cursor: copy !important;\">Figurine of Wondrous Power, Golden Lions</h1></div><div class=\"ve-stats__wrp-h-source  ve-flex-v-baseline\" style=\"display: flex !important; align-items: baseline !important;\"><br></div></div><span class=\"col-resize-handle\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0px; right: 0px; width: 5px; height: 100%; cursor: col-resize; background: transparent; z-index: 5;\"></span></th></tr><tr><td class=\"ve-rd-item__type-rarity-attunement\" colspan=\"6\" style=\"padding: 1px 4px; position: relative;\"><div class=\"ve-flex-col\" style=\"display: flex !important; flex-direction: column !important;\"><div class=\"ve-split \" style=\"display: flex !important; justify-content: space-between !important;\"><div class=\"ve-italic\" style=\"font-style: italic !important;\">Wondrous Item, Rare</div></div></div><span class=\"col-resize-handle\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0px; right: 0px; width: 5px; height: 100%; cursor: col-resize; background: transparent; z-index: 5;\"></span></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"padding: 1px 4px; position: relative;\"><span class=\"col-resize-handle\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0px; right: 0px; width: 5px; height: 100%; cursor: col-resize; background: transparent; z-index: 5;\"></span></td><td colspan=\"4\" style=\"padding: 1px 4px; position: relative;\"><span class=\"col-resize-handle\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0px; right: 0px; width: 5px; height: 100%; cursor: col-resize; background: transparent; z-index: 5;\"></span></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"6\" class=\"ve-py-0\" style=\"padding-right: 4px; padding-left: 4px; position: relative;\"><span class=\"col-resize-handle\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0px; right: 0px; width: 5px; height: 100%; cursor: col-resize; background: transparent; z-index: 5;\"></span></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"6\" class=\"ve-pb-2\" style=\"padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 4px; padding-left: 4px; padding-bottom: 0.5rem !important; position: relative;\"><div class=\"ve-rd__b  ve-rd__b--2\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 5px;\">A Figurine of Wondrous Power is a statuette small enough to fit in a pocket. If you take a Magic action to throw the figurine to a point on the ground within 60 feet of yourself, the figurine becomes a living creature specified in the figurine's description below. If the space where the creature would appear is occupied by other creatures or objects, or if there isn't enough space for the creature, the figurine doesn't become a creature.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 5px;\">The creature is Friendly to you and your allies. It understands your languages, obeys your commands, and takes its turn immediately after you on your Initiative count. If you issue no commands, the creature defends itself but takes no other actions.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 5px;\">The creature exists for a duration specific to each figurine. At the end of the duration, the creature reverts to its figurine form. It reverts to a figurine early if its creature form drops to 0Hit Points or if you take a Magic action while touching the creature to make it revert to figurine form. When the creature becomes a figurine again, its property can't be used again until a certain amount of time has passed, as specified below.</p><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Golden Lions (Rare)\" class=\"ve-rd__b  ve-rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"ve-rd__h ve-rd__h--3\" data-title-index=\"3\" style=\"line-height: inherit; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic; color: rgb(194, 194, 194);\"><span class=\"entry-title-inner \">Golden Lions (Rare).</span></span>These gold statuettes of lions are always created in pairs. You can use one figurine or both simultaneously. Each can become a Lion for up to 1 hour. Once a lion has been used, it can't be used again until 7 days have passed.</p></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div></div></div><div><br></div><div><!--StartFragment--><table id=\"pagecontent\" class=\"ve-w-100 ve-stats\" data-proficiency-dice-mode=\"bonus\" style=\"border-spacing: 0px; border-collapse: collapse; width: 556px; font-family: Convergence, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.6px; table-layout: fixed; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(187, 187, 187); background: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important;\"><t