lass=\"ve-rd__b  ve-rd__b--named ve-rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"ve-rd__h ve-rd__h--3\" data-title-index=\"10\" style=\"line-height: inherit; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic; color: rgb(194, 194, 194);\"><span class=\"entry-title-inner \">Running Leap.&nbsp;</span></span>With a 10-foot running start, the lion can Long Jump up to 25 feet.</p></div><span class=\"col-resize-handle\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0px; right: 0px; width: 5px; height: 100%; cursor: col-resize; background: transparent; z-index: 5;\"></span></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"6\" style=\"padding: 1px 4px; position: relative;\"><h3 class=\"ve-stats__sect-header-inner\" style=\"font-family: Convergence, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 100; line-height: 18px; color: rgb(210, 154, 56); margin-top: 3px; margin-bottom: -1px; font-size: 17px; font-variant: small-caps; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(210, 154, 56);\">Actions</h3><span class=\"col-resize-handle\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0px; right: 0px; width: 5px; height: 100%; cursor: col-resize; background: transparent; z-index: 5;\"></span></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"6\" class=\"ve-stats__sect-row-inner\" style=\"padding: 0.5rem 4px 1px; position: relative;\"><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Multiattack\" class=\"ve-rd__b  ve-rd__b--named ve-rd__b--3\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5px;\"><p><span class=\"ve-rd__h ve-rd__h--3\" data-title-index=\"6\" style=\"line-height: inherit; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic; color: rgb(194, 194, 194);\"><span class=\"entry-title-inner \">Multiattack.&nbsp;</span></span>The lion makes two Rend attacks. It can replace one attack with a use of Roar.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Rend\" class=\"ve-rd__b  ve-rd__b--named ve-rd__b--3\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5px;\"><p><span class=\"ve-rd__h ve-rd__h--3\" data-title-index=\"7\" style=\"line-height: inherit; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic; color: rgb(194, 194, 194);\"><span class=\"entry-title-inner \">Rend.&nbsp;</span></span><i>Melee Attack Roll:</i><span class=\"ve-roller render-roller\" title=\"Click to roll. SHIFT to roll with advantage, CTRL to roll with disadvantage.\" onmousedown=\"event.preventDefault()\" data-packed-dice=\"{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;dice&quot;,&quot;rollable&quot;:true,&quot;displayText&quot;:&quot;+5&quot;,&quot;toRoll&quot;:&quot;1d20+5&quot;,&quot;subType&quot;:&quot;d20&quot;,&quot;d20mod&quot;:&quot;+5&quot;,&quot;context&quot;:{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;hit&quot;}}\" data-roll-prof-type=\"d20\" data-roll-prof-dice=\"+1d4 + 3\" style=\"color: rgb(125, 182, 232); cursor: pointer;\"><span class=\"ve-rd__roller--roll-prof-bonus\" style=\"display: inline;\">+5</span></span>, reach 5 ft.<i>Hit:</i>7 (<span class=\"ve-roller render-roller\" title=\"Click to roll. SHIFT to roll a critical hit, CTRL to half damage (rounding down).\" onmousedown=\"event.preventDefault()\" data-packed-dice=\"{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;dice&quot;,&quot;rollable&quot;:true,&quot;toRoll&quot;:&quot;1d8 + 3&quot;,&quot;displayText&quot;:&quot;1d8 + 3&quot;,&quot;subType&quot;:&quot;damage&quot;}\" style=\"color: rgb(125, 182, 232); cursor: pointer;\">1d8 + 3</span>) Slashing damage.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Roar\" class=\"ve-rd__b  ve-rd__b--named ve-rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"ve-rd__h ve-rd__h--3\" data-title-index=\"8\" style=\"line-height: inherit; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic; color: rgb(194, 194, 194);\"><span class=\"entry-title-inner \">Roar.&nbsp;</span></span><i>Wisdom Saving Throw:</i>DC<span class=\"ve-rd__dc ve-rd__dc--rollable\" data-roll-prof-type=\"dc\" data-roll-prof-dice=\"1d4 + 9\"><span class=\"ve-rd__dc--rollable-text\" style=\"display: inline;\">11</span></span>, one creature within 15 feet.&nbsp;<i>Failure:&nbsp;</i>The target has the Frightened condition until the start of the lion's next turn.</p></div><span class=\"col-resize-handle\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0px; right: 0px; width: 5px; height: 100%; cursor: col-resize; background: transparent; z-index: 5;\